    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fantasy Creature Jigsaws</i> features 30 beautiful puzzles themed around Dragons, Goblins, Manticores, Vampires, Unicorns, and Elves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle is timed, offering an engaging experience as you race against the clock. Puzzles get larger as you progress within each category adding to the challenge. Earn achievements for every puzzle you complete and use cloud saves to effortlessly transfer your progress between devices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880820/extras/70620eab221130461a8249354328d4d4.avif?t=1732074405\" width=766 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the magical world of fantasy creatures and test your puzzle-solving skills!</p>",
